From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn <tyn@localhost>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:34:46 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: add the mo6tw-pc, mo6tw-pc-zhs and mo6tw-pc-zht profiles

TYN-only. Profiles and gamedefinitions entries for the Windows/Steam release
of Memories Off 6 T-Wave (InstructionSet MO6TWPC; Japanese, Simplified and
Traditional Chinese variants).

They use the generic switches added earlier in the series
(Game.VoiceTableLittleEndian, Dialogue.NameInsideNametag,
SaveData.AllowMissingImplementation) and UseMsbStrings. Sprite, HUD and font
width tables are generated (headers point to tools/impacto/mo6tw-pc/*.py in
yuukana1/Tyranor-Next-Impacto); HUD coordinates are the PS3 profile scaled
x1.5 where the PC sheets are exact 1.5x copies.

Known gaps: Dialogue.KeyWaitIconPos is {0, 0} like upstream mo6tw/mo8, not
measured (TODO(tyn)); there is no save system for the PC release yet.
SW_MESWIN0TYPE/SW_MESMODE0 are moved 60 down because the common layout's
4422 collides with the third mask priority on PC (commented in
scriptvars.lua).

